==Trivia==
This card is one of several featured in the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion's "Safari Zone" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], all of which can be found in the [[Kanto Safari Zone]] in Generations {{gen|I}} and {{gen|III}}.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration, by [[Miki Tanaka]], was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fossil|Slowpoke|55}} from the {{TCG|Fossil}} expansion. The illustration rare print, which features new artwork by Tanaka, offers a wider view of the original artwork.
*'''Tail Whap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Wooper|66}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

